exports[`FreightPlanCard > snapshot do card com 2 produtos e a prévia ligada 1`] = `"<button type="button">Dobrar quantidade</button><input aria-label="Observações" value=""><div role="group" aria-label="Plano de volumes do frete" data-testid="freight-plan-card" class="mt-3 space-y-3"><div class="space-y-2"><div role="radiogroup" aria-required="false" dir="ltr" class="grid gap-2" aria-label="Como distribuir os produtos nas caixas" tabindex="0" style="outline: none;"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="true" data-state="checked" value="misturar" class="aspect-square h-5 w-5 touch-manipulation rounded-full border border-primary text-primary ring-offset-background focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" id="ID" tabindex="-1" data-radix-collection-item=""><span data-state="checked" class="flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle h-2.5 w-2.5 fill-current text-current" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg></span></button><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none transition-all duration-200 peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70 hover:text-primary active:opacity-80 cursor-pointer" for="ID">Misturar produtos na mesma caixa</label></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-state="unchecked" value="separar" class="aspect-square h-5 w-5 touch-manipulation rounded-full border border-primary text-primary ring-offset-background focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" id="ID" tabindex="-1" data-radix-collection-item=""></button><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none transition-all duration-200 peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70 hover:text-primary active:opacity-80 cursor-pointer" for="ID">Caixas separadas por produto</label></div></div></div><section class="space-y-3 rounded-lg border p-4"><header class="space-y-1"><h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-truck h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2"></path><path d="M15 18H9"></path><path d="M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14"></path><circle cx="17" cy="18" r="2"></circle><circle cx="7" cy="18" r="2"></circle></svg>Volumes para transporte</h3><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">1× M · 708 g · 0,05 m³ · cubado 8,5 kg</p></header><div class="space-y-3"><div class="space-y-2"><div id="ID" class="space-y-2"><div data-state="closed" class="rounded-md border"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-3 p-3 text-left text-sm"><span class="space-y-0.5"><span class="block font-medium">Volume 1 · Caixa M</span><span class="block text-muted-foreground">4× Caderneta kraft B6 com porta caneta, 10× Caneta reciclavel</span></span><span class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2"><span class="font-medium">0,7 kg</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-data-[state=open]:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button><div data-state="closed" id="ID" hidden="" style=""></div></div></div></div><div class="space-y-1 text-sm text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-500"><div class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-exclamation-point lucide-alert-triangle lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg><div>1 caixa M vai com menos de metade do espaço aproveitável ocupado.</div></div></div></div><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Estimativa para transporte — caixas padrão da empresa</p></section><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:gap-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><button type="button" role="switch" aria-checked="true" data-state="checked" value="on" class="peer inline-flex h-6 w-11 shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center rounded-full border-2 border-transparent transition-all duration-300 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-4 focus-visible:ring-primary/20 focus-visible:ring-offset-0 active:scale-90 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 data-[state=checked]:bg-primary data-[state=unchecked]:bg-muted" id="ID" aria-describedby="ID"><span data-state="checked" class="pointer-events-none block h-5 w-5 rounded-full bg-background shadow-lg ring-0 transition-all duration-200 data-[state=checked]:translate-x-5 data-[state=unchecked]:translate-x-0 data-[state=checked]:scale-110 data-[state=unchecked]:scale-100"></span></button><label class="font-medium transition-all duration-200 peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70 hover:text-primary active:opacity-80 cursor-pointer text-sm" for="ID">Mostrar volumes ao cliente</label></div><p id="ID" class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">O cliente vê só o total, sem caixas nem avisos.</p></div><div data-testid="freight-plan-client-preview" class="space-y-1 rounded-md border border-dashed p-3"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground">Como o cliente verá</p><p class="text-sm">1 volume · 708 g · 0,05 m³</p></div></div>"`;
